  - number fields
  - numerical algebraic geometry
  - Selmer groups
  - certificates
abstract: >-
  Arbogast is a certificate-first computational mathematics library for finite exact
  cohomology, pinned number-field arithmetic, finite Kummer and 2-Selmer problems, finite exact
  deformation theory, validated numerical algebraic geometry, symmetry, and Hurwitz arithmetic.
  Its bounded numeric-to-exact bridge keeps enclosures, recognition candidates, exactification,
  and generic-degree witnesses at distinct proof levels. It separates discovery from verification
  and records mathematical results in provenance-preserving claim graphs.
